.bundle
vendor

# Not committed: a lock generated on Windows pins mingw-only builds of
# google-protobuf and sass-embedded, which fail to install on the Linux CI
# runner. Regenerating it on Windows pulls gem versions that fail to build
# locally. CI resolves fresh against the Gemfile instead.
Gemfile.lock

